		copyright protection and is free for you to use without restriction.
	</p>

	<h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
	<p>
		We may revise these Terms &amp; Conditions at any time. Continued use of
		the Site after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised
		terms.
	</p>

	<h2>Contact us</h2>
	<p>
		Questions about these Terms? Email us at{" "}
		<a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a> or visit our{" "}
		<a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.
